cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SpineMetrix core: sagittal spinal parameter computation"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release (DOI below)."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/arlindomontagnoli/spinemetrix-core"
url: "https://spinemetrix.com"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-22"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22900527"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the sagittal spinal parameters computed by SpineMetrix
  (pelvic incidence, pelvic tilt, sacral slope, lumbar lordosis and thoracic kyphosis)
  from marked vertebra corners on sagittal radiographs. Published for reproducibility:
  it is the same code that runs in the application.
keywords:
  - spine
  - sagittal balance
  - pelvic incidence
  - radiographic measurement
  - reproducibility
